OL,3,AMPs seek to overturn ruling that stops
OL,4,Apolice being sued for failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative Andrew Mitchell and
OL,7,FLabour's Jess Phillips have submitted
OL,8,Fan amendment to a bill being debated in
OL,9,FParliament next week seeking to
OL,10,Fcounteract the ruling.
OL,12,FSeparately, the judgment could also be
OL,13,Foverturned at a Supreme Court appeal
OL,14,Fthis month.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
